<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>PPT on 每日深度思考</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/tags/ppt/</link><description>Recent content in PPT on 每日深度思考</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>blog@baifan.site (ByF)</managingEditor><webMaster>blog@baifan.site (ByF)</webMaster><copyright>CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 14:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.baifan.site/tags/ppt/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>一个 PPT Agent 的完整拆解：从需求调研到 SVG 出图</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/ppt-agent-workflow-deep-dive/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF)</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/ppt-agent-workflow-deep-dive/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;市面上绝大多数所谓 AI PPT 工具，本质上只是“输入主题 → 套用死板模板 → 输出低质排版”的玩具。要真正达到商业交付水准，核心在于将生成链路解构为带确定性约束的多阶段流水线：从需求调研与资料检索，到大纲策划与版面规划，再到利用 SVG Bento Grid 结构化渲染。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>